            "description": {
              "content": "Record a user behavioral event via the Footprint Growth Analytics (FGA) platform. Supports standard event types (install, sign_up, login, open_app, play_game, reward) and custom event properties. Events appear in dashboards within approximately one minute of ingestion.\n",
